{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TryAngle: Shapes Warfare</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced, addictive shoot 'em up with a twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't shoot!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your TryAngle <strong>never stops moving -</strong> focus on dodging enemy shapes to reach the often-changing checkpoints to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather power-ups</strong> to assist you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn coins</strong> to unlock new TryAngle skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live, die, and retry!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costs as much as a \ud83c\udf6a cookie, but is fun for longer and is sugar-free!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC MODE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your way through hordes of enemies, Grab power-ups, and and survive for as long as you can! How far can you make it?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Player Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op Classic Mode with a slightly ramped up difficulty.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your game time counts down to 0 you'll <strong>EXPLODE,</strong> collect the time power-up to extend your play time to get a better high score.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cruel Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An over whelming amount of enemies with less power-ups. <strong>The ultimate challenge.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shields Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat